    "t": "<p>Beräkna.</p><div class=\"deluppgifter\" style=\"display:grid;gap:0.85rem;margin:0.8rem 0;\"><div>a) \\((-1)\\cdot7+4\\)</div><div>b) \\((-1)\\cdot(-12)-5\\)</div><div>c) \\(-(-9)-6\\)</div></div>",
