    "s": "<p>Svar: D. \\(\\frac23\\div\\frac34=\\frac23\\cdot\\frac43=\\frac89\\). Multiplikation skulle ge \\(\\frac12\\), addition \\(\\frac{17}{12}\\) och subtraktion \\(-\\frac1{12}\\).</p>",
