    "niva": "E",
    "poang": "2/0/0",
    "t": "<p>Graferna visar linjerna \\(A\\) och \\(B\\).</p><span class=\"fig\"><svg width=\"455\" height=\"320\" viewBox=\"0 0 455 320\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Två parallella räta linjer i koordinatsystem med rutnät\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"453\" height=\"318\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\"/><defs><clipPath id=\"clip2180\"><rect x=\"55\" y=\"30\" width=\"375\" height=\"240\"/></clipPath></defs><g class=\"grid\" stroke=\"#ECE9E5\" stroke-width=\"1\"><line x1=\"55\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"55\" y2=\"270\"/><line x1=\"101.88\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"101.88\" y2=\"270\"/><line x1=\"148.75\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"148.75\" y2=\"270\"/><line x1=\"195.63\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"195.63\" y2=\"270\"/><line x1=\"242.5\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"242.5\" y2=\"270\"/><line x1=\"289.38\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"289.38\" y2=\"270\"/><line x1=\"336.25\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"336.25\" y2=\"270\"/><line x1=\"383.13\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"383.13\" y2=\"270\"/><line x1=\"430\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"430\" y2=\"270\"/><line x1=\"55\" y1=\"270\" x2=\"430\" y2=\"270\"/><line x1=\"55\" y1=\"235.71\" x2=\"430\" y2=\"235.71\"/><line x1=\"55\" y1=\"201.43\" x2=\"430\" y2=\"201.43\"/><line x1=\"55\" y1=\"167.14\" x2=\"430\" y2=\"167.14\"/><line x1=\"55\" y1=\"132.86\" x2=\"430\" y2=\"132.86\"/><line x1=\"55\" y1=\"98.57\" x2=\"430\" y2=\"98.57\"/><line x1=\"55\" y1=\"64.29\" x2=\"430\" y2=\"64.29\"/><line x1=\"55\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"430\" y2=\"30\"/></g><g stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"><line x1=\"47\" y1=\"167.14\" x2=\"437\" y2=\"167.14\"/><line x1=\"242.5\" y1=\"278\" x2=\"242.5\" y2=\"22\"/></g><g fill=\"#50494B\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono,monospace\" font-size=\"10.5\"><text x=\"55\" y=\"292\" text-anchor=\"middle\">-4</text><text x=\"101.88\" y=\"292\" text-anchor=\"middle\">-3</text><text x=\"148.75\" y=\"292\" text-anchor=\"middle\">-2</text><text x=\"195.63\" y=\"292\" text-anchor=\"middle\">-1</text><text x=\"242.5\" y=\"292\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><text x=\"289.38\" y=\"292\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><text x=\"336.25\" y=\"292\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><text x=\"383.13\" y=\"292\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><text x=\"430\" y=\"292\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><text x=\"46\" y=\"274\" text-anchor=\"end\">-3</text><text x=\"46\" y=\"239.71\" text-anchor=\"end\">-2</text><text x=\"46\" y=\"205.43\" text-anchor=\"end\">-1</text><text x=\"46\" y=\"136.86\" text-anchor=\"end\">1</text><text x=\"46\" y=\"102.57\" text-anchor=\"end\">2</text><text x=\"46\" y=\"68.29\" text-anchor=\"end\">3</text><text x=\"46\" y=\"34\" text-anchor=\"end\">4</text></g><g clip-path=\"url(#clip2180)\"><line x1=\"55\" y1=\"235.71\" x2=\"430\" y2=\"-38.57\" stroke=\"#3F7FB8\" stroke-width=\"3\"/></g><g clip-path=\"url(#clip2180)\"><line x1=\"55\" y1=\"372.86\" x2=\"430\" y2=\"98.57\" stroke=\"#315F91\" stroke-width=\"3\"/></g><text x=\"298.75\" y=\"48.86\" fill=\"#3F7FB8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\">A</text><text x=\"369.06\" y=\"131.14\" fill=\"#315F91\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\">B</text><text x=\"440\" y=\"160.14\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\">x</text><text x=\"250.5\" y=\"20\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\">y</text></svg></span><p>Bestäm \\(k\\), \\(m\\) och ekvationen för båda linjerna.</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p><strong>Steg 1:</strong> Båda linjerna ökar 1 steg i y-led när x ökar med 1, så båda har \\(k=1\\).</p><p>Linje A skär y-axeln vid 2 och linje B vid −2.</p><p><strong>Svar:</strong> <strong>\\(A:y=x+2\\) och \\(B:y=x-2\\).</strong></p></div></div>",
    "familj": "Bestämma räta linjens ekvation",
    "geogebra": false,
    "miniräknare": false,
    "svarstyp": "flera_delar",
    "rättSvar": [
      1,
      2,
      "y=x+2",
      1,
      -2,
      "y=x-2"
    ],
    "tolerans": null,
    "självrättning": true,
    "formaga": [
      "procedur"
    ],
    "svarEtiketter": [
      "A: k",
      "A: m",
      "A: ekvation",
      "B: k",
      "B: m",
      "B: ekvation"
    ],
    "svarsstruktur": "ordnad",
    "ledtrad": "<p>Behandla linjerna en i taget: läs av y-axelskärningen och använd två tydliga punkter för att hitta lutningen.</p>",
    "traningsniva": 2,
    "arbetsinsats": 2,
    "spel": true
