    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p>a) \\(f(4)=16+2=\\)<strong>18</strong>.</p><p>b) \\(x^2+2=18\\Rightarrow x^2=16\\), alltså <strong>\\(x=-4\\) eller \\(x=4\\)</strong>.</p></div></div>",
