"288.0\" stroke=\"#E8E7EA\"/><text x=\"238.9\" y=\"291.0\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"monospace\" font-size=\"9\">-2</text><line x1=\"48\" y1=\"254.8\" x2=\"406\" y2=\"254.8\" stroke=\"#E8E7EA\"/><text x=\"238.9\" y=\"257.8\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"monospace\" font-size=\"9\">-1</text><line x1=\"48\" y1=\"221.5\" x2=\"406\" y2=\"221.5\" stroke=\"#E8E7EA\"/><line x1=\"48\" y1=\"188.2\" x2=\"406\" y2=\"188.2\" stroke=\"#E8E7EA\"/><text x=\"238.9\" y=\"191.2\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"monospace\" font-size=\"9\">1</text><line x1=\"48\" y1=\"155.0\" x2=\"406\" y2=\"155.0\" stroke=\"#E8E7EA\"/><text x=\"238.9\" y=\"158.0\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"monospace\" font-size=\"9\">2</text><line x1=\"48\" y1=\"121.8\" x2=\"406\" y2=\"121.8\" stroke=\"#E8E7EA\"/><text x=\"238.9\" y=\"124.8\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"monospace\" font-size=\"9\">3</text><line x1=\"48\" y1=\"88.5\" x2=\"406\" y2=\"88.5\" stroke=\"#E8E7EA\"/><text x=\"238.9\" y=\"91.5\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"monospace\" font-size=\"9\">4</text><line x1=\"48\" y1=\"55.2\" x2=\"406\" y2=\"55.2\" stroke=\"#E8E7EA\"/><text x=\"238.9\" y=\"58.2\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"monospace\" font-size=\"9\">5</text><line x1=\"48\" y1=\"22.0\" x2=\"406\" y2=\"22.0\" stroke=\"#E8E7EA\"/><text x=\"238.9\" y=\"25.0\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"monospace\" font-size=\"9\">6</text><line x1=\"48\" y1=\"221.5\" x2=\"406\" y2=\"221.5\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><line x1=\"246.9\" y1=\"288\" x2=\"246.9\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><line x1=\"246.9\" y1=\"221.5\" x2=\"127.6\" y2=\"88.5\" stroke=\"#B43123\" stroke-width=\"2.8\"/><polygon points=\"127.6,88.5 140.2,94.7 132.4,101.6\" fill=\"#B43123\"/><text x=\"195.2\" y=\"147.0\" font-family=\"monospace\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#B43123\">u</text></svg></span>",
    "s": "<p><strong>Nyckelidé:</strong> Läs av förflyttningen från vektorns startpunkt till dess slutpunkt. Den går 3 steg åt vänster och 4 steg uppåt.</p><p>Åt vänster ger negativ x-komponent och uppåt positiv y-komponent.</p><p><strong>Svar: \\(\\vec u=(-3,4)\\).</strong></p>",
