        "t": "<p>En månadsbudget är 24 000 kr. Boende 9 000, mat 3 600, resor 1 800.</p><span class=\"fig\"><svg aria-label=\"månadsbudget uppdelad i fyra kategorier\" height=\"260\" role=\"img\" viewbox=\"0 0 470 260\" width=\"470\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect fill=\"#fff\" height=\"258\" rx=\"10\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" width=\"468\" x=\"1\" y=\"1\"></rect><text font-family=\"monospace\" font-size=\"11\" x=\"45\" y=\"35\">månadsbudget: 24 000 kr</text><rect fill=\"#F5F3F0\" height=\"60\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" width=\"142.5\" x=\"45.0\" y=\"60\"></rect><text font-family=\"monospace\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"116.2\" y=\"96\">1</text><rect fill=\"#F5F3F0\" height=\"60\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" width=\"57.0\" x=\"187.5\" y=\"60\"></rect><text font-family=\"monospace\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"216.0\" y=\"96\">2</text><rect fill=\"#F5F3F0\" height=\"60\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" width=\"28.5\" x=\"244.5\" y=\"60\"></rect><text font-family=\"monospace\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"258.8\" y=\"96\">3</text><rect fill=\"#F5F3F0\" height=\"60\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" width=\"152.0\" x=\"273.0\" y=\"60\"></rect><text font-family=\"monospace\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"349.0\" y=\"96\">4</text><text font-family=\"monospace\" font-size=\"10\" x=\"65\" y=\"155\">1 = boende: 9 000 kr</text><text font-family=\"monospace\" font-size=\"10\" x=\"65\" y=\"177\">2 = mat: 3 600 kr</text><text font-family=\"monospace\" font-size=\"10\" x=\"65\" y=\"199\">3 = resor: 1 800 kr</text><text font-family=\"monospace\" font-size=\"10\" x=\"65\" y=\"221\">4 = övrigt: 9 600 kr</text></svg></span><div class=\"spel-en-del\">Andel som återstår?</div>",
